==Prestige class tips==

*The [[pale master]] is a strong prestige class that builds upon the wizard's magical abilities.

== Notes ==

* Wizards learn two new spells at each level-up and from wizard scrolls they find during play.
** At first level (not just when beginning the game), the spell allotment is increased, allowing a wizard to learn all cantrips and a number of additional (level 1) spells equal to three plus intelligence modifier (not a static four, as mentioned in-game). This is still subject to the wizard needing a base intelligence score of 10 + spell level to learn a spell.
*As part of their starting equipment (regardless of [[package]]), wizards receive four scrolls, one each of of ''sleep'', ''protection from alignment'', ''magic missile'' and ''summon creature I''.
*Which spells are memorized on rest are selected using the spell-book (shortcut key B).
*Due to a bug in OC the class-based branch in random loot generator arcane scrolls not available from random loot after druid multiclassing. Lesser percentage for wizard scrolls.

